[0.508,0.508,0.508],"color":"#c7c11a"}],"groundAnnotations":[],"groundNormArrows":[],"groundPolygon3ds":[],"groundColorSampleAnnotations":[],"meta":{"detail":"<b>形，远柔而近利</b>\n\n大气透视\n——万物像被同一套空气笼罩，彼此关系自然归于一境","category":"氛围"}}